{
  "id": 8867180216519,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 24",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-24",
  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we offer this custom comforter set, perfect for baseball enthusiasts. This personalized bedding set allows you to celebrate your love for the game and create a unique space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Ideal for baseball players, fans, and lovers, emphasizing determination.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process to maintain dye and prevent fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric, known for being soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Filling:</strong> Contains Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> Perfect gift for men, women, moms, dads, for occasions like Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Set Name</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
